dType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"close_class":"env_integration","comments":[{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"2026-09-09T11:00Z claimed for P1 investigation. Starting with read-only reproduction/enumeration from Gerrit REST plus live main refs before any host/ref mutation. Will assess whether Gerrit MERGED patches are absent from main, then repair main contents first if needed; no --force, no ref surgery without snapshot/evidence.","timestamp":1788951767960343001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"2026-09-09T11:03Z read-only reproduction complete. Gerrit refs/heads/main and GitHub origin/main both currently resolve to e61b6bdae7423c9e8cd885dc50a20ce685f79280. Querying merged branch:main changes after 2026-09-07 and testing current_revision reachability from origin/main found 18 MERGED revisions not ancestors and with no Change-Id hit on main: 2802 59850948619e, 2803 46dc98e5ecc8, 2807 94c42343c1ba, 2808 878ee2362e9e, 2809 85abd2fbfbdf, 2810 af20ccffd83e, 2811 d91def6dfa05, 2812 a80e0bc4c4c9, 2816 17b267cadb6c, 2817 290c33322bab, 2818 cca18d7d8c5e, 2820 c3d7e142d07b, 2821 42a589d33d39, 2822 a76e4de01266, 2823 2a93f18044c1, 2825 7f014af78903, 2826 9fb63c321957, 2827 560d6ac34d2e. Adjacent changes 2790-2801 and 2819/2824/2828+ are reachable, so this is a bounded fork/history-loss interval, not a general query bug. Assessing blast radius next: whether patch contents are absent from main or later re-landed.","timestamp":1788951941834351001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"2026-09-09T11:07Z blast-radius finding: the affected commits exist in local/Gerrit object storage, but none are ancestors of main and stable patch-id comparison found no equivalent patches on current origin/main. This means main is missing real work, not just Gerrit metadata. Two orphan chains both fork from 665d1d048018: chain A 46dc98e5->...->a76e4de0 (14 commits) and chain B 2a93f180->...->7f014af7 (4 commits). I am restoring contents first by cherry-picking the missing patches onto current main into a fresh Gerrit change, rather than editing refs in place.","timestamp":1788952061343357001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Update: repair commit f2e3cc58899a was verified locally (make verify PYTEST_WORKERS=8 with GIT_CONFIG_* unset) and push to refs/for/main was rejected because Gerrit disallows merge uploads: 'you are not allowed to upload merges'. That confirms the proper-review merge path cannot make the orphaned MERGED revisions ancestors. Next step is snapshot-backed Gerrit ref repair for reachability, then send the Mirror Guard merged-reachability prevention as a normal single-parent Gerrit change.","timestamp":1788955452041786001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Pre-repair snapshots taken before Gerrit ref surgery: root vol-0270fcf13709cf472 -> snap-05e22893edd5c2b57; data vol-06fa2e77a9dd97527 -> snap-0908542d147c74b0c. Snapshot start 2026-09-09T12:05Z. Repair plan: use the locally verified merge repair commit f2e3cc58899a4554a0dd3d110a78accbe6c419be to restore the orphaned MERGED revisions as ancestors of main, then verify reachability and full repository connectivity.","timestamp":1788955532858289001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Recovery/RCA evidence 2026-09-09T12:25Z: confirmed direct cause was the object-store repair command on Gerrit host updating branch refs from the stale GitHub mirror: refs/heads/main was moved back to 665d1d0480 by 'fetch --prune https://github.com/navapbc/rebar.git +refs/heads/*:refs/heads/*' at 2026-09-08T06:03:29Z and again at 09:40:28Z. That left Gerrit NoteDb changes marked MERGED while their patchset revisions were no longer reachable from main. Repair: after completed EBS snapshots snap-05e22893edd5c2b57 (root) and snap-0908542d147c74b0c (data), I advanced Gerrit refs/heads/main from 154db1aadb892dd305c71e3e488c556b613ab208 to merge repair commit 611f030c19b4bf440ed1befdfe32d0b454ba16d1, preserving current main as first parent and the locally verified recovery commit f2e3cc58899a4554a0dd3d110a78accbe6c419be as second parent. Backup ref: refs/repair-backups/noolbenger-20260909T121206Z. Host verification: all 18 affected revisions are ancestors of main; git fsck --full --connectivity-only completed (dangling objects only) and printed fsck=ok. Replication start --all --wait succeeded. Gerrit and GitHub main now both resolve to 385ddee1bc02a4bddb7d6aaec0b18ee3770ec1af, a descendant of the repair. Local Mirror Guard verification from current main returned exit_code=0: replication in sync and all 100 checked MERGED revisions reachable. Scratch upload verification: Gerrit accepted WIP change 2909 after repair; it was immediately abandoned.","timestamp":1788956488993365001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Discovered follow-up: supersolar-ample-badger (c8dc-9fb2-ddfa-45d0), to codify the safe Gerrit object-store repair runbook/tooling so mirror recovery fetches hydrate quarantine refs and never write stale mirror heads directly into Gerrit refs/heads/* again.","timestamp":1788957335141695001}],"completion_expectation":"required","created_at":1788918382893090001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"3b33d69a-ba11-43ac-bb6e-441c115dee52","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"3e32-a859-2153-4a1b"}],"description":"## Context\nDuring documentation-epic closeout, Gerrit REST reported changes 2809, 2810, 2812, 2817, and 2821 as status MERGED on branch main. Their reported current revisions are respectively 85abd2fbfbdff, af20ccffd83e9, a80e0bc4c4c9, 290c33322bab, and 42a589d33d39.\n\nBoth live refs currently resolve to d99198e64414e7dc2607b8dbe7acdacbb3cf944f:\n- gerrit refs/heads/main\n- origin refs/heads/main\n\nEvery reported merged revision above fails git merge-base --is-ancestor against that head, and current main contains none of their Change-Id trailers. Later changes 2855-2858 are reachable normally, so this is a bounded historical interval rather than a general query mistake.\n\n## Impact\nA Gerrit change can appear safely merged while its patch is absent from main. Ticket closeout and automation that trust status=MERGED can falsely claim work landed. The affected comment-remediation leaves must be re-landed as fresh corrections instead of being closed against these orphaned revisions.\n\n## Investigation scope\nA separate debug session should determine whether this came from an authorized main-history rewrite, Gerrit submit/rebase behavior, replication, or ref corruption; enumerate the full affected interval; and establish the durable invariant between MERGED status and branch reachability. Do not debug or fix this inside rubbery-glacial-cowbird.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [x] Reproduce the mismatch from live Gerrit REST and refs.\n- [x] Identify the proven root cause and the full affected change set.\n- [x] Restore or explicitly reconcile every affected patch.\n- [x] Add a deterministic guard or operational check that detects MERGED revisions not reachable from their destination branch.\n- [x] Record recovery and prevention evidence on this bug.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"4e8b83fc-fa5f-4390-89c4-a39763213e29","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":1,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"closed","tags":["gerrit","integrity","debug-handoff"],"ticket_id":"8c0b-7f16-1ea0-4afc","ticket_type":"bug","title":"Gerrit MERGED changes 2809–2821 are unreachable from current main","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["b037e79f-7d8b-4c48-8eb7-c843e83e7452","0cd62e1c-1020-42a4-9221-d16304296925","ec348023-975f-4d23-9e49-3d5ad06a9ede","375d2727-e319-4a5a-88ae-fee040da0e9d","3279a9da-3459-4c00-98a3-2c85a070f614","89cc74f6-1ede-44d0-b672-374b9856b6dc","1c540def-51ed-4e2d-bf15-ee0cb7ef1d21","0a6f790d-b4c2-4bcf-93c8-c50c5d327da0","21ff16b5-a73e-4186-a764-eab8d4588881","4e8b83fc-fa5f-4390-89c4-a39763213e29","8b8edb6c-56b3-4ba4-b83c-5a89ad6667b2","3f206067-db1b-4982-b362-5138406eca61"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1788959644357791001,"uuid":"526f0f09-51b2-48ea-af85-2c4dec113d9e"}